    <string name="help_text">• Drag across the cube to turn a layer. Flick for a quick turn.\n\n• Drag on the empty space around the cube to rotate the whole cube. Use two fingers anywhere to rotate, pinch to zoom, and twist to roll.\n\n• Double-tap the background, or tap the target icon, to reset the view.\n\n• The lock icon stops the cube from rotating by accident while you turn layers.\n\n• After a scramble, the timer starts with your first move and stops when every face is a single color. Turn on 15-second inspection in Settings to study the cube first.\n\n• Hint and Solve use a real solver on 2×2 and 3×3 cubes. On bigger cubes, Solve rewinds every move back to the start.\n\n• Undo and Redo step through your moves. Your progress on every cube size is saved automatically.</string>
